  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.55 Workforce housing ordinance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.55 “Workforce housing ordinance” means a standalone ordinance or section in a zoning ordinance which allows for the development of workforce housing which complies with RSA 674:58-61.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
